<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: The Shattered Empire, once a symbol of tyranny and oppression, has crumbled. All over the planet, brave deserters rose in a chorus of rebellion, breaking the chains of servitude that held them bound. Every child who now wakes to the dawn of freedom will remember and revere these names, the names of the heroes who dared to challenge the impossible:
{0}
\nHowever, this is not the end, but merely a transition. With the old empire now but ruins and their flagship a burning wreckage fallen from the skies, a time for healing and rebuilding is upon us. The nobles, once loyal to the empire, now surrender to outlander communities or lose themselves in a life of crime. There's no denying the truth - the world has forever changed.
\nAs you stand at the threshold of a new era, you remember this chapter of defiance and courage. The echoes of the Shattered Empire will serve as a reminder of your resilience, a testament to your unfaltering quest for freedom. You look ahead, knowing that you are stepping into a future built on hope, unity, and liberation.-->
  <VFED.EndgameText>曾经是暴政和压迫象征的破碎帝国已经崩溃。在世界各地，勇敢的逃兵齐声反抗，打破了束缚他们的奴役锁链束缚。每一个在自由黎明中醒来的孩子都会记住并尊敬这些名字，那些敢于挑战不可能的英雄的名字：
{0}

然而，这并不是结束，而只是一个过渡。古老的帝国现在只剩下废墟，他们的旗舰也变成了从天而降的燃烧残骸，治愈和重建的时刻即将到来。曾经忠于帝国的贵族现在要么向外来者社区投降，要么迷失在犯罪的生活中。无可否认的事实是——世界已经永远改变了。

当你站在新时代的门槛上时，你会记得这一充满反抗和勇气的篇章。破碎帝国的回声将提醒你坚韧不拔，证明你对自由的坚定追求。你展望未来，知道你正在步入一个建立在希望、团结和解放基础上的未来。</VFED.EndgameText>
  <!--EN: You are about to initiate a final mission in Vanilla Factions Expanded: Deserters. After the mission is complete, the Empire and the Deserters will be no more. Are you sure you want to initiate the final mission?-->
  <VFED.EndgameWarningText>您即将在原版派系扩展版：逃兵中启动最后一个任务。任务完成后，帝国和逃兵都将不复存在。您确定要启动最终任务吗？</VFED.EndgameWarningText>
</LanguageData>
